OL,3,GNEWSAWhat next for the new Frimley Park
OL,4,AHospital?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-week public engagement exercise
OL,7,Fwith people in parts of Surrey,
OL,8,FBerkshire and Hampshire on the location
OL,9,Fof a new hospital and the future of
OL,10,Fhealth services ends on Monday 12
OL,11,FOctober.
OL,13,FUnder the plans, Frimley Park Hospital
OL,14,Fwould be rebuilt at a different site
OL,15,Fnearby.
OL,17,FThe impact of the proposed relocation
OL,18,Fon traffic, transport, schools, the
OL,19,Fenvironment and infrastructure are
OL,20,Famong the questions and concerns that
OL,21,Fhave been raised by the public since
OL,22,Fthe engagement started in June.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
