OL,3,GNEWSAWhat next for the new Frimley Park
OL,4,AHospital?
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief executive, Lance McCarthy,
OL,7,Fpreviously said that "a new Frimley
OL,8,FPark Hospital will mean safer
OL,9,Fbuildings, modern facilities and an
OL,10,Fenvironment that helps our staff
OL,11,Fdeliver the very best care."
